<!--
THESIS: 扫码授权后先确认“免费量房 · 免费设计”权益，再用连续服务路径承接待匹配结果。
OWN-WORLD: 极简透气版暖白纸面、家客绿步骤条、克制线框图标和单一绿色主动作。
STORY: 客户扫码后直接授权手机号，完成两步流程并获得已匹配设计师或等待派单。
FIRST VIEWPORT: 胶囊左侧使用正式家客来品牌锁；phoneAuth、success、pending、existing 各自在 390x844 同屏展示主内容与 CTA。
FORM: design-references/free-design-service-phone-auth-redesign-v1/free-design-service-phone-auth-v1.png
-->
<view class="claim-page state-{{pageState}}">
  <view
    class="claim-nav"
    style="padding-top: {{navigationTop}}px; min-height: {{navigationHeight}}px; padding-right: {{navigationRight}}px;"
  >
    <view class="nav-back" bindtap="onBack" aria-role="button" aria-label="返回">
      <view class="back-chevron"></view>
    </view>
    <view class="brand-lockup">
      <image class="brand-logo" src="/images/home-ip-v1/brand-logo.png" mode="aspectFit" />
      <text class="brand-name">家客来</text>
      <view class="nav-divider"></view>
      <text class="nav-title">{{navTitle}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{pageState === 'resolving'}}" class="claim-state resolving-state">
    <view class="resolving-mark"></view>
    <text class="state-title">正在确认服务</text>
    <text class="state-copy">请稍候，正在校验本次服务领取资格。</text>
  </view>

  <view wx:elif="{{pageState === 'phoneAuth'}}" class="claim-auth">
    <view class="claim-stepper">
      <view class="step done">
        <view class="step-dot"><view class="step-check"></view></view>
        <text class="step-label">扫码领取</text>
      </view>
      <view class="step-rail is-solid"></view>
      <view class="step current">
        <view class="step-dot">2</view>
        <text class="step-label">手机号授权</text>
      </view>
      <view class="step-rail"></view>
      <view class="step">
        <view class="step-dot">3</view>
        <text class="step-label">设计师匹配</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="auth-benefit-pass">
      <view class="auth-benefit-pill">双重免费权益</view>
      <view class="auth-benefit-main">
        <view class="auth-benefit-copy">
          <text class="auth-benefit-title">授权手机号，</text>
          <text class="auth-benefit-title">领取免费量房</text>
          <text class="auth-benefit-title">免费设计</text>
          <text class="auth-benefit-subtitle">仅用于本次服务联系</text>
        </view>
        <image
          class="auth-privacy-xiaok"
          src="/packages/business/assets/referral-service-v1/xiao-k-phone-privacy.png"
          mode="aspectFit"
        />
      </view>

      <view class="auth-benefit-grid">
        <view class="auth-benefit-item">
          <image
            class="auth-benefit-icon"
            src="/packages/business/assets/referral-service-v1/phone-auth-measure.png"
            mode="aspectFit"
          />
          <view class="auth-benefit-meta">
            <text class="auth-benefit-label">免费量房</text>
            <text class="auth-benefit-helper">专业人员上门测量</text>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="auth-benefit-item">
          <image
            class="auth-benefit-icon"
            src="/packages/business/assets/referral-service-v1/phone-auth-design.png"
            mode="aspectFit"
          />
          <view class="auth-benefit-meta">
            <text class="auth-benefit-label">免费设计</text>
            <text class="auth-benefit-helper">设计师沟通方案</text>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="auth-purpose-card">
      <text class="auth-purpose-title">授权后我们会</text>
      <view class="auth-purpose-list">
        <view class="auth-purpose-row">
          <view class="auth-purpose-icon">
            <image src="/packages/business/assets/referral-service-v1/phone-auth-calendar.png" mode="aspectFit" />
          </view>
          <view class="auth-purpose-copy">
            <text class="auth-purpose-label">预约量房联系</text>
            <text class="auth-purpose-helper">确认上门时间与地址</text>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="auth-purpose-row">
          <view class="auth-purpose-icon">
            <image src="/packages/business/assets/referral-service-v1/phone-auth-wechat.png" mode="aspectFit" />
          </view>
          <view class="auth-purpose-copy">
            <text class="auth-purpose-label">发送设计师微信</text>
            <text class="auth-purpose-helper">方便后续沟通方案</text>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="auth-privacy-strip">
        <image src="/packages/business/assets/referral-service-v1/phone-auth-privacy.png" mode="aspectFit" />
        <text>手机号仅用于本次服务，不公开、不出售</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <button
      class="claim-action"
      open-type="getPhoneNumber"
      bindgetphonenumber="onGetPhoneNumber"
      loading="{{submitting}}"
      disabled="{{submitting}}"
    >允许微信授权手机号</button>
    <view class="later-link" bindtap="onSkipAuth" aria-role="button">暂不授权</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:elif="{{pageState === 'success'}}" class="claim-success">
    <view class="claim-stepper">
      <view class="step done">
        <view class="step-dot"><view class="step-check"></view></view>
        <text class="step-label">扫码领取</text>
      </view>
      <view class="step-rail is-solid"></view>
      <view class="step done">
        <view class="step-dot"><view class="step-check"></view></view>
        <text class="step-label">手机号授权</text>
      </view>
      <view class="step-rail is-solid"></view>
      <view class="step done">
        <view class="step-dot"><view class="step-check"></view></view>
        <text class="step-label">设计师匹配</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="success-hero">
      <view class="hero-leaf hero-leaf-tl" aria-hidden="true"></view>
      <view class="hero-blob" aria-hidden="true"></view>
      <view class="hero-copy">
        <text class="ready-title success-title">设计师已为你匹配</text>
        <text class="ready-subtitle">服务档案已建立，后续进度可随时查看</text>
      </view>
      <image
        class="hero-xiaok"
        src="/packages/business/assets/referral-service-v1/thumbs-up-xiao-k.png"
        mode="aspectFit"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="success-contact-card">
      <view class="success-designer-head">
        <view class="success-designer-avatar">
          <image src="/images/mine-icons/user.png" mode="aspectFit" />
        </view>
        <view class="success-designer-meta">
          <text class="success-designer-name">{{designerProfile.displayName || '专属设计师'}}</text>
          <text class="success-designer-role">专属设计师</text>
        </view>
        <view class="success-match-status">
          <view class="success-match-dot" aria-hidden="true"></view>
          <text>已匹配</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="success-contact-purpose">
        <image src="/images/mine-icons/shield-check.png" mode="aspectFit" />
        <text>后续量房预约、户型确认与方案沟通由设计师微信跟进</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <button class="claim-action success-project-action" bindtap="onOpenProject">查看服务档案</button>
    <button
      class="claim-action-outline success-contact-action {{canContactDesigner ? '' : 'is-disabled'}}"
      bindtap="onOpenContactSheet"
      disabled="{{!canContactDesigner}}"
    >{{canContactDesigner ? '查看设计师微信' : '设计师联系方式同步中'}}</button>
    <text class="success-contact-helper">{{canContactDesigner ? '需要时可再次查看二维码或复制微信号' : '联系方式同步完成后即可查看'}}</text>
    <view class="service-needs-link" bindtap="onOpenServiceNeeds" aria-role="button">
      <text>有其他服务需求？补充一下</text>
      <text class="service-needs-chevron" aria-hidden="true">›</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:elif="{{pageState === 'existing'}}" class="claim-existing">
    <view class="existing-hero">
      <view class="existing-status-kicker">服务归属已保留</view>
      <view class="hero-copy">
        <text class="ready-title">你已有进行中的服务</text>
        <text class="ready-subtitle">无需重复领取，我们将继续为你保留当前服务安排</text>
      </view>
      <image
        class="hero-xiaok existing-xiaok"
        src="/packages/business/assets/referral-service-v1/thumbs-up-xiao-k.png"
        mode="aspectFit"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="existing-card">
      <view class="existing-head">
        <view class="existing-icon">
          <image src="/images/mine-icons/clipboard-pen.png" mode="aspectFit" />
        </view>
        <view class="existing-service-title">
          <text class="existing-service-name">免费设计服务 · {{existingServiceLabel || '客户'}}</text>
          <text class="existing-service-status">进行中</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="existing-stage-path">
        <view class="existing-stage {{existingStageIndex >= 0 ? 'is-done' : ''}} {{existingStageIndex === 0 ? 'is-current' : ''}}">
          <view class="existing-stage-dot">
            <view wx:if="{{existingStageIndex > 0}}" class="existing-stage-check"></view>
            <text wx:else>1</text>
          </view>
          <text class="existing-stage-label">需求确认</text>
        </view>
        <view class="existing-stage-line {{existingStageIndex > 0 ? 'is-done' : ''}}"></view>
        <view class="existing-stage {{existingStageIndex >= 1 ? 'is-done' : ''}} {{existingStageIndex === 1 ? 'is-current' : ''}}">
          <view class="existing-stage-dot">
            <view wx:if="{{existingStageIndex > 1}}" class="existing-stage-check"></view>
            <text wx:else>2</text>
          </view>
          <text class="existing-stage-label">量房安排</text>
        </view>
        <view class="existing-stage-line {{existingStageIndex > 1 ? 'is-done' : ''}}"></view>
        <view class="existing-stage {{existingStageIndex >= 2 ? 'is-done' : ''}} {{existingStageIndex === 2 ? 'is-current' : ''}}">
          <view class="existing-stage-dot">3</view>
          <text class="existing-stage-label">设计沟通</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="existing-update-row">
        <text class="existing-update-label">当前阶段</text>
        <text class="existing-update-value">{{serviceStageLabel || '服务进行中'}}</text>
        <text class="existing-update-time">{{lastUpdateLabel || '最近更新：今天'}}</text>
      </view>
      <button class="claim-action existing-primary" bindtap="onOpenProject">查看服务档案</button>
      <button
        class="claim-action-outline {{canContactDesigner ? '' : 'is-disabled'}}"
        bindtap="onContactDesigner"
        disabled="{{!canContactDesigner}}"
      >联系当前设计师</button>
    </view>

    <view class="existing-note">
      <image src="/images/mine-icons/shield-check.png" mode="aspectFit" />
      <text>当前服务归属已保留，不会重复创建新的服务记录</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:elif="{{pageState === 'pending'}}" class="claim-pending">
    <view class="claim-stepper">
      <view class="step done">
        <view class="step-dot"><view class="step-check"></view></view>
        <text class="step-label">扫码领取</text>
      </view>
      <view class="step-rail is-solid"></view>
      <view class="step done">
        <view class="step-dot"><view class="step-check"></view></view>
        <text class="step-label">手机号授权</text>
      </view>
      <view class="step-rail is-dashed"></view>
      <view class="step pending-step">
        <view class="step-dot">3</view>
        <text class="step-label">设计师匹配</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="pending-benefit-hero">
      <view class="pending-success-pill">
        <view class="pending-success-mark"><view class="step-check"></view></view>
        <text>领取成功</text>
      </view>

      <view class="pending-benefit-main">
        <view class="pending-benefit-copy">
          <text class="pending-benefit-title">免费量房 · 免费设计</text>
          <text class="pending-benefit-subtitle">权益已生效，正在为你匹配合适的设计师</text>
        </view>
        <image
          class="pending-spatial-xiaok"
          src="/packages/business/assets/referral-service-v1/xiao-k-spatial-service-guide.png"
          mode="aspectFit"
        />
      </view>

      <view class="pending-benefit-grid">
        <view class="pending-benefit-item">
          <image
            class="pending-benefit-icon"
            src="/packages/business/assets/referral-service-v1/onsite-measurement.png"
            mode="aspectFit"
          />
          <view class="pending-benefit-meta">
            <text class="pending-benefit-label">免费量房</text>
            <text class="pending-benefit-helper">专业人员上门测量</text>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="pending-benefit-item">
          <image
            class="pending-benefit-icon"
            src="/packages/business/assets/referral-service-v1/designer-service.png"
            mode="aspectFit"
          />
          <view class="pending-benefit-meta">
            <text class="pending-benefit-label">免费设计</text>
            <text class="pending-benefit-helper">设计师沟通方案</text>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="pending-journey-card">
      <text class="pending-journey-title">接下来这样进行</text>
      <view class="pending-journey-list">
        <view class="pending-journey-rail" aria-hidden="true"></view>

        <view class="pending-journey-item is-done">
          <view class="pending-journey-index">1</view>
          <view class="pending-journey-copy">
            <text class="pending-journey-label">需求已确认</text>
            <text class="pending-journey-helper">我们已收到你的需求</text>
          </view>
          <image
            class="pending-journey-icon"
            src="/packages/business/assets/referral-service-v1/designer-matching.png"
            mode="aspectFit"
          />
        </view>

        <view class="pending-journey-item">
          <view class="pending-journey-index">2</view>
          <view class="pending-journey-copy">
            <text class="pending-journey-label">安排上门量房</text>
            <text class="pending-journey-helper">匹配完成后为你预约</text>
          </view>
          <image
            class="pending-journey-icon"
            src="/packages/business/assets/referral-service-v1/onsite-measurement.png"
            mode="aspectFit"
          />
        </view>

        <view class="pending-journey-item">
          <view class="pending-journey-index">3</view>
          <view class="pending-journey-copy">
            <text class="pending-journey-label">设计师沟通</text>
            <text class="pending-journey-helper">围绕户型与需求沟通方案</text>
          </view>
          <image
            class="pending-journey-icon"
            src="/packages/business/assets/referral-service-v1/designer-service.png"
            mode="aspectFit"
          />
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="pending-note">
      <image src="/packages/business/assets/login-v1/wechat.png" mode="aspectFit" />
      <text>匹配完成后，我们会通过微信通知你</text>
    </view>

    <button class="claim-action" bindtap="onOpenProject">查看免费服务档案</button>
    <view class="later-link" bindtap="onLater" aria-role="button">稍后再看</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:else class="claim-state error-state">
    <image src="/images/mine-icons/shield-check.png" mode="aspectFit" />
    <text class="state-title">本次服务暂未领取</text>
    <text class="state-copy">{{errorMessage}}</text>
    <button class="state-action" bindtap="onRetry">重新确认</button>
  </view>

  <designer-contact-sheet
    visible="{{showContactSheet}}"
    designer="{{designerProfile}}"
    bind:close="closeContactSheet"
  />
</view>
